"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He’s gotten himself dressed up all proper and fancy,⟪k:2⟫but good clothes don’t make "
"him a good man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫虽然穿得好看了一点——⟪k:2⟫不过这家伙犯下得罪是不会消失的。"

