msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...Ahh... ⟪k:4⟫aaAAaah... ⟪k:5⟫Wh-⟪k:6⟫Why, ⟪k:7⟫why, ⟪k:8⟫why did you kill "
"her? ⟪k:9⟫Why did you kill her? ⟪k:10⟫Why did you kill her? ⟪k:11⟫Why did you kill her? ⟪k:12⟫Why "
"did you kill her? ⟪k:13⟫Why did you kill her...?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫………啊……⟪k:4⟫啊啊啊……⟪k:5⟫为、⟪k:6⟫为什么、⟪k:7⟫为什么、⟪k:8⟫杀了她、⟪k:9⟫杀了"
"她、⟪k:10⟫杀了她、⟪k:11⟫杀了她、⟪k:12⟫杀了她、⟪k:13⟫杀了她………"

