#: scenario2:scenario2_D138DAE7_5A54_4526_8D38_E50F0F258A3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d2efc2a2e3e1d2919e422de5a99b7250f11fad57e847d54c99d42e9d4c85b3b
