msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D138DAE7_5A54_4526_8D38_E50F0F258A3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The “beast” was a convenient skin for you to wear."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以——⟪k:1⟫对于你来说，⟪k:2⟫自己是野兽才正合你的心意。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F4E49F3B_D9CA_427E_B899_1389FEB24806
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45749339bce195a036685d576e4ded99a046ca99cbba97166820e8bee6f016c3
#. default-sha256: 05de78741c98713f49a42d1a01a81ffe6a02accee884797f12774367f8ca9ada
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F4E49F3B_D9CA_427E_B899_1389FEB24806"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You ⟪k:1⟫wanted⟪k:2⟫ to be a brutal, savage murderer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所谓杀人的野兽，⟪k:1⟫就是你自己吧？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0DB59C0_7113_42D1_8D06_E35BA1B5A873
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 443abb4d8c5cac477a48bd8d8f8618796125d0bf01f344da3f6ebf8c76bf4374
#. default-sha256: 423e2eb24ce7882987a7b204b9c3cd2d0e7682d5ff80fcd7d25b676b00ec5d8c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0DB59C0_7113_42D1_8D06_E35BA1B5A873"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You never really ⟪k:1⟫loved⟪k:2⟫ the White-Haired Girl—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or the black-haired woman, "
"for that matter. ⟪k:5⟫You were merely attached to them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫无论是白发的少女，⟪k:1⟫还是黑发的女性——⟪k:2⟫其实你并不爱她们吧？⟪k:3⟫你有的只是强烈的执着——"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2F776632_2AC1_49D6_88BF_680B9BAC172E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3700d125e7c9f98c893597824827b5ba2fcaafc10ea9fa7aacb2b4ac6f12820
#. default-sha256: 26a179a5fe85676b7301afe1d549e7b01749245cbe0ab355f0a663b7ff0c476e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2F776632_2AC1_49D6_88BF_680B9BAC172E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fixated on the idea of a world of tranquility."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——对名为「平稳的世界」的强烈执着。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A1664B25_FF83_4E44_A27A_85AAC594E212
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e1c3bb40c9a0557491d7655e041b1c61e7a57450afc134ba98a357b121df4a8
#. default-sha256: 4004a5fe14a02d0fd64170147ecc30ed3a8c5ad7940439dbdf2a06c1ef2bed20
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1664B25_FF83_4E44_A27A_85AAC594E212"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You used this peace to anchor yourself, to prevent you from drifting off into the ocean of "
"your desires. ⟪k:1⟫You yearned to cause pain..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你想用平静来维系被欲望所侵蚀的自身。⟪k:1⟫你想伤害别人——"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8B794FBB_C1CB_483B_A730_3ABA2ECE022E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9491c887d3f687d2a840f9a7b601acf3fb9924154491c15fc39efd290f57eedb
#. default-sha256: d1529aa62e772acfe7a9e916b3d95f2aabd0f7a37b0e9fb1acfd7c104ed37de4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8B794FBB_C1CB_483B_A730_3ABA2ECE022E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫while also hungering for the opposite—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a calm life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫同时又渴望平静的日常。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3152E2D5_15AB_4D42_B0D0_393AF5D0C640
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d556ea305b6f6f75073c556c7291b57f0f6ea3543da53b75d5538e0afdad968
#. default-sha256: fb43582ee19790670bbdb39056191bfb8618cf5da452a4d92522e8ff5564a172
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3152E2D5_15AB_4D42_B0D0_393AF5D0C640"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You idolized this idealized life, spent in quiet harmony with another, because you knew just "
"how difficult it would be for you to attain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫你十分憧憬——与温柔的人共同生活的世界吧？⟪k:1⟫因为你知道，⟪k:2⟫那种生活对自己来说有多么难得。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7F114237_89C5_4533_98C4_528D99C82EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f662e2ff270077c8546b44c79e2658d61eaa26e28e5e91a1afdb878fcfb21bff
#. default-sha256: aaeccdc376e02c21cda65c84eb9203a7389dc8c2ee868323631fe7f35c403894
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7F114237_89C5_4533_98C4_528D99C82EE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Far more difficult for you than satisfying your cravings—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but not impossible."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫对你来说，这应该是一条比屈从于欲望更加困难的路。⟪k:1⟫但是，⟪k:2⟫也不是不可能实现的吧？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_35DF5C94_9240_4038_B519_C29D0C6FFB68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72ff247046a166945ece7ede6db65c7875e5b9e425f3f8691d68a12e874e9de1
#. default-sha256: fdd27b27fa0c2b59784f36bd98d45b995c5a5c5a788045f194e831a2938a23bf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_35DF5C94_9240_4038_B519_C29D0C6FFB68"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, had hoped you would find peace with someone rather than descend into savagery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆认为，⟪k:1⟫与其沦落为野兽——⟪k:2⟫你更愿意与谁一起过上平静的生活。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2DDE1EA6_53AD_4419_8B34_EA7E06C24F79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02a3cb545b082e40a0d608f4c85f7272af3544886caa2b9bda5156032184a5f3
#. default-sha256: 39caafe0516d488f0b6eca12c40fdd14318415f410ca3a56d4c2d96bfc5ba658
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2DDE1EA6_53AD_4419_8B34_EA7E06C24F79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It may have only been superficial...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but it would have been very human."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即使，⟪k:1⟫是虚假的平静也无所谓……⟪k:2⟫真是具有人性的想法呢。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A94EA007_E8EB_41A7_8D34_81E107BB89BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd7b81d01c91a16dba98066a62ea563ea48f3ddce570925775ad15451431ac9a
#. default-sha256: d094bd2caca88296b8fa6db1f08e48b6df226242d299f88525021e29f2eb5172
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A94EA007_E8EB_41A7_8D34_81E107BB89BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But ultimately, peace slipped through your fingers..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是最终……⟪k:1⟫你失去了平静——"

#: scenario2:scenario2_86C1D961_1270_428E_9173_02F4CA02C9FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5017a1764e70546aaf92649d867f187e72b903e1e8204e36c6cf5d7851a9ad00
#. default-sha256: 3a8b2f870d751d831b2b5510b81bc834ba6f2a4be0039d532a1733663979d9cb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86C1D961_1270_428E_9173_02F4CA02C9FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and no one was left to suppress your desires. ⟪k:1⟫You cannot, after all, hold them back "
"yourself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因为，⟪k:1⟫你阻止不了自己吧？⟪k:2⟫能阻止你欲望的人，⟪k:3⟫已经不存在了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_03D04C05_B7DF_4E7B_A9FB_9B8158470996
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d403978d1cf19ef7984cfa3ba1e589e9775d848138e727385e1497b010fe284b
